### INSTRUCTION
Write a recursive Python function to generate Fibonacci numbers.

### OUTPUT
def fibonacci(n):
    if n == 1 or n == 2:
        return 1
    else:
        return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)

print(fibonacci(10))

